    ("gov_m8_49", "International Organizations: AU Pan-African Parliament", "2018", "The legislative consultative body of the African Union, located in Midrand, South Africa, is the:", ["Pan-African Parliament (PAP)", "African Commission on Human Rights", "Economic and Social Council", "African Court of Justice"], 0, "The Pan-African Parliament provides a continental platform for African legislators to consult and promote democratic governance.", "Easy"),
